1
00:00:08,670 --> 00:00:11,030
Don't smile.

2
00:00:11,940 --> 00:00:19,180
Will you leave me in the end even if you smile at me now?

3
00:00:20,050 --> 00:00:23,330
When you get what you want,

4
00:00:25,230 --> 00:00:29,030
You're going to leave me.

5
00:00:32,220 --> 00:00:35,630
You said I'll do whatever you ask me to do,

6
00:00:39,370 --> 00:00:43,270
Until you tell me to leave,

7
00:00:44,220 --> 00:00:47,510
I'll stay with you.

8
00:02:07,440 --> 00:02:11,680
I knew you were preparing for the recipe contest.

9
00:02:11,680 --> 00:02:14,620
This tastes good.

10
00:02:16,350 --> 00:02:19,270
How do you know that?

11
00:02:22,790 --> 00:02:25,460
Did you think I'd rely on you

12
00:02:25,460 --> 00:02:28,830
without knowing about you?

13
00:02:42,260 --> 00:02:44,510
What?

14
00:02:53,940 --> 00:02:55,690
Wait here for Kwang Soo,

15
00:02:55,690 --> 00:02:57,860
okay?

16
00:03:06,330 --> 00:03:08,710
What's going on?

17
00:03:20,970 --> 00:03:25,010
The board decided to sell it.

18
00:03:25,010 --> 00:03:30,010
When the financial team comes up with a price,

19
00:03:30,560 --> 00:03:33,020
they'll sell it right away.

20
00:03:33,020 --> 00:03:35,440
If we take out a loan using our restaurant chain,

21
00:03:35,440 --> 00:03:37,070
we won't have to sell it.

22
00:03:37,070 --> 00:03:42,560
To get the amount of money we need, Hannamdong Lady is our only hope.

23
00:03:43,270 --> 00:03:46,480
I can't sell it while my father's away.

24
00:03:46,480 --> 00:03:48,710
He has the final say.

25
00:03:48,710 --> 00:03:51,570
I'll make an appointment,

26
00:03:51,940 --> 00:03:54,700
but don't expect too much of it,

27
00:03:55,450 --> 00:03:59,180
Everybody wants their share.

28
00:03:59,590 --> 00:04:02,270
Don't you want the K Corporation?

29
00:04:02,270 --> 00:04:07,520
My father abandoned his wife and children for the sake of money,

30
00:04:07,520 --> 00:04:11,040
I watched my brother growing up.

31
00:04:13,430 --> 00:04:16,440
I'm good for now.

32
00:04:35,990 --> 00:04:39,310
Mr. Jo Min Hyuk was here.

33
00:04:47,910 --> 00:04:50,970
You don't look happy.

34
00:04:50,970 --> 00:04:52,460
No.

35
00:04:52,460 --> 00:04:55,760
I actually dealt him a big blow.

36
00:04:56,530 --> 00:05:00,120
But it doesn't make me feel better.

37
00:05:01,530 --> 00:05:04,060
You heard about the decision?

38
00:05:04,060 --> 00:05:08,680
If Min Hyuk can't keep the restaurant chain,

39
00:05:08,680 --> 00:05:10,820
it'll be harder for him.

40
00:05:10,820 --> 00:05:15,850
Well, as far as I'm concerned, it's not that hard for him.

41
00:05:15,850 --> 00:05:19,920
He's still clinging to what he has,

42
00:05:20,350 --> 00:05:23,860
so he must be okay.

43
00:05:32,380 --> 00:05:35,560
Yoo Jung! Have a seat.

44
00:05:37,050 --> 00:05:38,810
Yoo Jung, it's autumn.

45
00:05:38,810 --> 00:05:41,670
You need to take care of your skin.

46
00:05:41,670 --> 00:05:43,350
You're not 20 anymore.

47
00:05:43,350 --> 00:05:45,630
Look at you. Your lips are all chapped.

48
00:05:45,630 --> 00:05:48,830
You need to be ready for a new relationship.

49
00:05:49,090 --> 00:05:50,730
Yoo Jung,

50
00:05:50,730 --> 00:05:55,560
I spent a month's rent on this.

51
00:05:55,560 --> 00:05:57,970
I'll give it to you.

52
00:05:57,970 --> 00:06:02,030
Yoo Jung, you should know that I'm nice to you.

53
00:06:02,030 --> 00:06:04,680
If you have that much money,

54
00:06:04,680 --> 00:06:07,710
pay your rent.

55
00:06:08,880 --> 00:06:14,990
Yoo Jung, how far did you go with Mr. Jo?

56
00:06:15,880 --> 00:06:19,320
Have you kissed each other?

57
00:06:21,370 --> 00:06:24,730
Hae Ri! Stop!

58
00:06:25,900 --> 00:06:27,770
I think you did.

59
00:06:27,770 --> 00:06:29,650
I have to go.

60
00:06:29,650 --> 00:06:32,500
That's great.

61
00:06:35,380 --> 00:06:36,670
Rent!

62
00:06:36,670 --> 00:06:38,220
Three, four!

63
00:06:38,450 --> 00:06:40,830
An ordinary happy birthday song

64
00:06:40,830 --> 00:06:45,710
doesn't suit your special day.

65
00:06:45,710 --> 00:06:51,550
So, we made a special birthday song for you.

66
00:06:51,550 --> 00:06:54,440
It's a happy day. It's a joyful day.

67
00:06:54,440 --> 00:06:57,130
The world is beautiful.

68
00:06:57,130 --> 00:07:03,670
We're happy and joyful to celebrate

69
00:07:03,670 --> 00:07:08,660
your birthday.

70
00:07:08,660 --> 00:07:11,090
Sir.

71
00:07:11,090 --> 00:07:13,000
What?

72
00:07:13,000 --> 00:07:15,560
Happy birthday!

73
00:07:15,560 --> 00:07:16,980
No present?

74
00:07:16,980 --> 00:07:19,580
Sorry.

75
00:07:23,260 --> 00:07:26,220
- Go bring Yoo Jung in. - Happy birthday to you.

76
00:07:26,220 --> 00:07:29,180
Happy birthday.

77
00:07:35,180 --> 00:07:38,670
You chose it, you'll do the presentation.

78
00:07:38,670 --> 00:07:39,930
Excuse me?

79
00:07:39,930 --> 00:07:42,260
Have you finished the sauce?

80
00:07:42,260 --> 00:07:43,290
Yes.

81
00:07:43,290 --> 00:07:45,250
We'll meet the investor tomorrow.

82
00:07:45,250 --> 00:07:48,190
We need to raise the value of our restaurant.

83
00:07:48,190 --> 00:07:51,450
Write your recipe down and prepare a plan.

84
00:07:51,450 --> 00:07:53,300
Sir,

85
00:07:53,300 --> 00:07:54,990
That's beyond my ability.

86
00:07:54,990 --> 00:07:59,080
How can you revenge while making food in the kitchen?

87
00:07:59,080 --> 00:08:03,740
Don't think that I'll help you for no reason.

88
00:08:11,410 --> 00:08:13,540
Ahn Do Hoon,

89
00:08:14,000 --> 00:08:17,210
he is trying to sell the restaurant.

90
00:08:17,210 --> 00:08:19,140
You jsut need to stop him

91
00:08:19,140 --> 00:08:21,650
and I'll keep what's mine.

92
00:08:21,650 --> 00:08:25,590
It's a win-win situation, okay?

93
00:08:35,270 --> 00:08:36,360
What is it?

94
00:08:36,360 --> 00:08:38,130
The Security Room called.

95
00:08:38,130 --> 00:08:41,720
The footage has been recovered.

96
00:09:17,960 --> 00:09:20,610
How did it go?

97
00:09:21,570 --> 00:09:24,530
You're here.

98
00:09:30,160 --> 00:09:34,780
I didn't know you'd be down here so quickly.

99
00:09:34,780 --> 00:09:37,680
I was going to watch something fun.

100
00:09:37,680 --> 00:09:40,090
Let's watch it together.

101
00:09:40,090 --> 00:09:43,550
Kwang Soo! Let's start.

102
00:10:19,800 --> 00:10:25,460
Kwang Soo remembered that he went to the cafe on that night.

103
00:10:30,740 --> 00:10:35,170
Did you call me to show me this?

104
00:10:35,170 --> 00:10:36,980
What?

105
00:10:36,980 --> 00:10:41,350
It's not fun for you because you 've already seen it?

106
00:10:41,350 --> 00:10:43,330
Yes.

107
00:10:43,330 --> 00:10:46,900
I was with Yoo Jung on that night.

108
00:10:48,230 --> 00:10:50,660
So,

109
00:10:51,790 --> 00:10:55,370
I can guess what you're looking for.

110
00:10:55,370 --> 00:11:01,330
But the place in the video isn't the scene of the accident.

111
00:11:01,330 --> 00:11:05,400
This can't prove anything.

112
00:11:06,050 --> 00:11:07,490
Excuse me.

113
00:11:07,490 --> 00:11:11,160
If this can't prove anything...

114
00:11:11,720 --> 00:11:15,360
Why did you find it so desperately

115
00:11:15,360 --> 00:11:18,790
and even delete it?

116
00:11:23,340 --> 00:11:26,480
Why?

117
00:11:48,300 --> 00:11:50,190
It's him!

118
00:11:50,190 --> 00:11:53,320
That bastard was driving on that night.

119
00:11:53,320 --> 00:11:54,610
Kang Yoo Jung!

120
00:11:54,610 --> 00:11:57,460
You idiot!

121
00:11:57,460 --> 00:11:58,980
Like Ahn Do Hoon said,

122
00:11:58,980 --> 00:12:00,920
the black box footage can't prove anything.

123
00:12:00,920 --> 00:12:03,720
Make it work!

124
00:12:04,900 --> 00:12:07,640
Let's go to the prosecutor's office.

125
00:12:09,800 --> 00:12:12,650
Steak and pasta.

126
00:12:13,000 --> 00:12:15,580
Here's your dish.

127
00:12:15,580 --> 00:12:18,060
Enjoy!

128
00:12:19,830 --> 00:12:22,290
Let's talk.

129
00:12:34,640 --> 00:12:36,650
What's got you so afraid that you'd come here?

130
00:12:36,650 --> 00:12:38,410
Did you tell him?

131
00:12:38,410 --> 00:12:40,950
Did you tell Min Hyuk that I was driving?

132
00:12:40,950 --> 00:12:43,020
I'm not that stupid.

133
00:12:43,020 --> 00:12:45,530
It's you who make me terrible,

134
00:12:45,530 --> 00:12:51,030
I'm the one who's suffering from your noble sacrifice.

135
00:12:52,020 --> 00:12:53,660
I'm working.

136
00:12:53,660 --> 00:12:57,150
If you want to talk to me, wait until I'm done working.

137
00:12:58,030 --> 00:13:02,310
The prosecutor and the defendant were lovers.

138
00:13:03,310 --> 00:13:06,290
And the prosecutor was Ahn Do Hoon.

139
00:13:06,290 --> 00:13:07,400
So what?

140
00:13:07,400 --> 00:13:09,750
Is that it?

141
00:13:10,140 --> 00:13:11,970
Doesn't the case have to be tried again?

142
00:13:11,970 --> 00:13:15,650
If there were a conflict of interest due to a personal relationship,

143
00:13:15,650 --> 00:13:18,490
we would change a prosecutor.

144
00:13:18,490 --> 00:13:20,940
However, he made a justice prosecution,

145
00:13:20,940 --> 00:13:24,390
there's nothing illegal about that.

146
00:13:24,390 --> 00:13:28,160
The defendant can file a complaint,

147
00:13:28,160 --> 00:13:31,000
but that isn't the case.

148
00:13:31,000 --> 00:13:33,360
If the defendant wasn't the real killer,

149
00:13:33,360 --> 00:13:35,110
could we ask for a retrial?

150
00:13:35,110 --> 00:13:37,230
What are you talking about?

151
00:13:37,230 --> 00:13:40,300
That would shake the entire prosecution system.

152
00:13:40,300 --> 00:13:44,620
Without solid evidence, it's not going to happen.

153
00:13:46,910 --> 00:13:48,120
What?

154
00:13:48,120 --> 00:13:49,440
Do you have solid evidence?

155
00:13:49,440 --> 00:13:51,580
If I did,

156
00:13:52,090 --> 00:13:55,490
would you take this case?

157
00:13:56,020 --> 00:13:59,480
Who is the real?

158
00:14:00,930 --> 00:14:02,980
Are you saying

159
00:14:02,980 --> 00:14:06,450
Do Hoon did it?

160
00:14:06,450 --> 00:14:09,370
Do you have any other evidence?

161
00:14:09,370 --> 00:14:14,800
Did you hide something to use against me?

162
00:14:14,800 --> 00:14:16,900
Yes,

163
00:14:16,900 --> 00:14:19,160
Look at you,

164
00:14:19,160 --> 00:14:23,810
I really wish I had hid something.

165
00:14:24,610 --> 00:14:28,220
You can't break me down with that accident.

166
00:14:28,220 --> 00:14:32,280
I'm not that mean.

167
00:14:32,280 --> 00:14:36,390
I'm not like you.

168
00:14:36,390 --> 00:14:37,990
Why?

169
00:14:37,990 --> 00:14:41,120
Are you afraid of losing too much?

170
00:14:41,120 --> 00:14:45,640
Enjoy what you have now.

171
00:14:45,640 --> 00:14:48,560
I'll drag you down to the bottom myself.

172
00:14:48,560 --> 00:14:52,070
Enjoy it while you can.

173
00:14:52,500 --> 00:14:55,410
What's going on?

174
00:15:00,050 --> 00:15:02,170
Are you okay?

175
00:15:02,330 --> 00:15:04,120
I'm fine.

176
00:15:05,310 --> 00:15:07,620
Bye.

177
00:15:20,530 --> 00:15:24,000
Yoo Jung, this is your workplace.

178
00:15:24,000 --> 00:15:26,670
If you want to chat with men during work hours,

179
00:15:26,670 --> 00:15:28,530
you should resign.

180
00:15:28,650 --> 00:15:31,270
Don't think that you can do everything you want because Mr. Jo cares about you.

181
00:15:31,270 --> 00:15:35,460
Sorry! It won't happen again.

182
00:15:46,320 --> 00:15:48,000
Who was that?

183
00:15:48,000 --> 00:15:52,610
Mr. Ahn came to see me.

184
00:15:54,360 --> 00:15:55,500
What for?

185
00:15:55,500 --> 00:15:58,080
It's a personal thing.

186
00:15:58,450 --> 00:16:02,500
Don't get the wrong idea.

187
00:16:02,500 --> 00:16:06,010
I won't, if you tell me not to.

188
00:16:23,260 --> 00:16:28,210
If you told me that you weren't driving on that day...

189
00:16:29,150 --> 00:16:33,840
And Do Hoon was the one who was driving...

190
00:16:36,320 --> 00:16:40,570
You won't be entangled with me.

191
00:16:40,570 --> 00:16:42,300
No.

192
00:16:43,020 --> 00:16:45,100
Even if...

193
00:16:46,690 --> 00:16:50,110
Even if I hadn't been driving,

194
00:16:50,110 --> 00:16:52,810
I was there with him.

195
00:16:53,320 --> 00:16:57,090
On the night that she passed away,

196
00:16:57,090 --> 00:16:59,990
I was definitely there.

197
00:17:01,820 --> 00:17:05,450
It's natural for you to be angry with me.

198
00:17:05,450 --> 00:17:09,400
What you ask me to do isn't tired at all,

199
00:17:09,400 --> 00:17:11,570
But...

200
00:17:12,410 --> 00:17:15,680
I'm afraid I might forget about it

201
00:17:15,680 --> 00:17:18,430
and live as if nothing happened.

202
00:17:19,690 --> 00:17:22,300
That's what I'm afraid of.

203
00:17:54,500 --> 00:17:56,940
Sorry! The subscriber you dialed can not be connected for the moment...

204
00:18:08,120 --> 00:18:10,380
Set another date.

205
00:18:10,380 --> 00:18:18,900
Next time... Call me after Min Hyuk gets here.

206
00:18:21,620 --> 00:18:25,440
Do it as if I were the customer.

207
00:18:26,500 --> 00:18:28,260
Start.

208
00:18:29,850 --> 00:18:31,710
Start right now.

209
00:18:36,500 --> 00:18:40,040
It's a happy day. It's a joyful day.

210
00:18:40,040 --> 00:18:43,000
The world is beautiful.

211
00:18:43,000 --> 00:18:45,130
Do it again! Do it again!

212
00:18:45,490 --> 00:18:48,290
Is this how you do it for our customers?

213
00:18:48,290 --> 00:18:50,120
You should smile sincerely.

214
00:18:50,120 --> 00:18:51,590
You can also dance.

215
00:18:51,590 --> 00:18:53,960
I saw you did a good job earlier.

216
00:18:54,110 --> 00:18:56,440
Look at me.

217
00:18:58,100 --> 00:19:01,380
It's a happy day. It's a joyful day.

218
00:19:01,380 --> 00:19:03,280
Start.

219
00:19:04,950 --> 00:19:06,430
Come on.

220
00:19:09,100 --> 00:19:10,970
What are you doing?

221
00:19:14,100 --> 00:19:17,570
It's a happy day. It's a joyful day.

222
00:19:17,570 --> 00:19:20,440
- The world is beautiful. - Louder.

223
00:19:20,440 --> 00:19:27,080
- Louder. - We're happy and joyful to celebrate...

224
00:19:28,470 --> 00:19:37,990
Your birthday...

225
00:19:37,990 --> 00:19:41,240
Happy birthday!

226
00:19:44,490 --> 00:19:46,700
That's how you spend your birthday.

227
00:19:54,990 --> 00:19:57,640
I didn't want to bother you,

228
00:19:57,640 --> 00:20:00,500
but I had to do my duty.

229
00:20:10,140 --> 00:20:12,130
Happy birthday!

230
00:20:12,730 --> 00:20:16,110
I'm sorry, something just happened.

231
00:20:16,110 --> 00:20:17,660
Something?

232
00:20:18,380 --> 00:20:20,710
Do you mean this?

233
00:20:22,400 --> 00:20:24,920
It's so like you.

234
00:20:39,540 --> 00:20:42,840
Is it his birthday today?

235
00:20:42,840 --> 00:20:44,120
Yes.

236
00:21:00,230 --> 00:21:01,910
What?

237
00:21:02,670 --> 00:21:05,170
It is my birthday today.

238
00:21:05,600 --> 00:21:10,700
Why didn't you ask her about the accident?

239
00:21:11,100 --> 00:21:18,240
Don't you think she has the answer that you want to hear?

240
00:21:18,560 --> 00:21:22,800
She won't tell me. Kang Yoo Jung.

241
00:21:24,870 --> 00:21:27,340
The most solid evidence

242
00:21:29,690 --> 00:21:34,540
I should hear from Ahn Do Hoon.

243
00:21:36,500 --> 00:21:39,620
The lady that Min Hyuk is going to meet

244
00:21:39,650 --> 00:21:42,460
tomorrow is more important than the board.

245
00:21:42,460 --> 00:21:46,180
Is that why Mr. Jo changed his schedule for tomorrow?

246
00:21:46,180 --> 00:21:48,820
If she decides to invest,

247
00:21:48,820 --> 00:21:52,610
the board will side with Min Hyuk

248
00:21:52,610 --> 00:21:55,160
rather than going through the complicated selling process.

249
00:21:55,160 --> 00:21:57,680
That's a large sum of money.

250
00:21:57,680 --> 00:22:03,870
That's why Min Hyuk is going to her in person.

251
00:22:03,870 --> 00:22:09,570
All the contracts signed outside of the company have to go through the Legal Team.

252
00:22:09,570 --> 00:22:14,280
I'll check the contract in person.

253
00:22:15,190 --> 00:22:19,770
Yoo Jung will accompany Min Hyuk tomorrow.

254
00:22:21,800 --> 00:22:25,900
I'll expect your performance tomorrow.

255
00:22:45,310 --> 00:22:46,770
Even if

256
00:22:46,770 --> 00:22:50,160
I wasn't driving,

257
00:22:50,160 --> 00:22:52,600
I was there with him.

258
00:22:53,250 --> 00:22:55,270
Idiot.

259
00:22:56,990 --> 00:23:02,000
Even if Yoo Jung wasn't driving, what would you do?

260
00:23:22,890 --> 00:23:26,700
I don't know how to bow and scrape to others.

261
00:23:26,700 --> 00:23:28,900
I've never done it before.

262
00:23:28,900 --> 00:23:31,040
I'm counting on you.

263
00:23:41,170 --> 00:23:43,960
Come on in.

264
00:23:49,920 --> 00:23:51,870
Hello.

265
00:23:51,870 --> 00:23:52,920
I'm really appreciate that

266
00:23:52,920 --> 00:23:58,970
your Legal Team came first to tell me about the investment condition in detail.

267
00:23:59,140 --> 00:24:00,300
Really?

268
00:24:00,300 --> 00:24:02,060
Have a seat.

269
00:24:12,780 --> 00:24:14,580
This is our proposal.

270
00:24:14,580 --> 00:24:17,520
You have a talented employee.

271
00:24:17,520 --> 00:24:24,600
Mr. Ahn has offered me a good plan.

272
00:24:24,600 --> 00:24:28,930
You've been investing a lot of money with the K Corporation.

273
00:24:28,930 --> 00:24:31,750
I thought you should look through the information we have first

274
00:24:31,750 --> 00:24:35,210
before you make a decision.

275
00:24:35,360 --> 00:24:40,280
Why should I invest in King's Restaurant?

276
00:24:40,280 --> 00:24:45,730
I can't just give you this money simply because I know you.

277
00:24:47,260 --> 00:24:51,460
Can I use your kitchen?

278
00:24:51,700 --> 00:24:53,450
Go ahead.

279
00:25:05,430 --> 00:25:08,520
I didn't prepare a main dish on purpose.

280
00:25:08,520 --> 00:25:10,770
I have confidence that our sauce

281
00:25:10,770 --> 00:25:15,330
will go well with any dish.

282
00:25:26,810 --> 00:25:33,400
My father owned a bakery for a long time.

283
00:25:35,480 --> 00:25:37,950
I'm so fond of sweet food,

284
00:25:37,950 --> 00:25:40,700
so he made buns with vegetables.

285
00:25:40,700 --> 00:25:46,950
He mixed those vegetables that I didn't like with the sauce.

286
00:25:47,360 --> 00:25:49,710
Even though he passed away.

287
00:25:49,710 --> 00:25:53,950
The taste still lingers in my memory.

288
00:25:53,950 --> 00:25:56,840
When you think of King's Restaurant,

289
00:25:56,840 --> 00:26:00,780
the lingering taste is our value.

290
00:26:00,780 --> 00:26:03,690
This is not Ms. Kang's private business.

291
00:26:03,690 --> 00:26:06,120
Sell your personal nostalgia somewhere else.

292
00:26:06,120 --> 00:26:09,900
I'm not here to sell my personal nostalgia.

293
00:26:12,070 --> 00:26:14,240
I'm confident

294
00:26:14,240 --> 00:26:17,580
that our new sauce will appeal to the taste buds of our customers.

295
00:26:17,580 --> 00:26:20,320
Being confidnet isn't enough.

296
00:26:20,320 --> 00:26:22,990
As the biggest shareholder, the King Hotel...

297
00:26:22,990 --> 00:26:25,680
I'm the owner of the restaurant.

298
00:26:25,710 --> 00:26:28,620
I thought you were here as a consultant on this deal.

299
00:26:28,620 --> 00:26:35,590
I'm not here to represent the restaurant, I'm representing the K Corporation.

300
00:26:38,010 --> 00:26:41,860
The taste do linger in my mouth,

301
00:26:43,060 --> 00:26:46,780
You're working for the K Corporation, but you don't trust each other.

302
00:26:46,780 --> 00:26:49,460
Yet, you want my money.

303
00:26:49,460 --> 00:26:51,570
It's unreasonable.

304
00:26:51,570 --> 00:26:55,880
The rumors that President Jo is seriously ill must be true.

305
00:26:55,920 --> 00:26:59,840
What a disharmonious team.

306
00:27:02,930 --> 00:27:04,930
Someone from the Shinhwa Hotel is here.

307
00:27:04,930 --> 00:27:06,670
I have another appointment.

308
00:27:06,670 --> 00:27:10,090
I'll think about it and get back to you.

309
00:27:27,360 --> 00:27:29,050
Mr. Ahn.

310
00:27:29,230 --> 00:27:33,360
You make me angry playing dirty like this.

311
00:27:37,960 --> 00:27:40,660
I just did what the board asked me to do.

312
00:27:40,660 --> 00:27:43,910
I'm sorry if I offended you.

313
00:27:43,910 --> 00:27:45,750
Is that so?

314
00:27:47,410 --> 00:27:49,410
Hang in there.

315
00:27:49,410 --> 00:27:51,920
Until I go back.

316
00:27:52,910 --> 00:27:54,350
Let's go.

317
00:28:03,800 --> 00:28:05,860
Thank you.

318
00:28:07,520 --> 00:28:11,280
For making me more disappointed in you.

319
00:28:35,330 --> 00:28:36,830
I'm sorry.

320
00:28:36,830 --> 00:28:39,590
Don't be sorry.

321
00:28:39,900 --> 00:28:41,160
But because of me...

322
00:28:41,160 --> 00:28:42,940
It's not your fault.

323
00:28:42,940 --> 00:28:45,730
Nothing's been decided.

324
00:28:46,250 --> 00:28:47,070
But...

325
00:28:47,070 --> 00:28:49,080
Stop!

326
00:28:49,260 --> 00:28:51,250
Can't you blame others?

327
00:28:51,250 --> 00:28:52,810
It's easy.

328
00:28:52,810 --> 00:28:56,690
If something goes wrong, blame Ahn Do Hoon.

329
00:29:17,540 --> 00:29:18,560
What's this?

330
00:29:18,560 --> 00:29:20,520
For your birthday.

331
00:29:20,520 --> 00:29:22,530
It's a cream bun.

332
00:29:22,530 --> 00:29:25,410
I don't have an oven, so I used a steamer.

333
00:29:25,410 --> 00:29:29,840
It doesn't look good, but it tastes good.

334
00:29:30,570 --> 00:29:32,280
I don't like sweet stuff.

335
00:29:32,280 --> 00:29:33,930
Right.

336
00:29:36,750 --> 00:29:40,300
Do you want to have dinner, then?

337
00:29:46,000 --> 00:29:48,050
Take care.

338
00:30:04,900 --> 00:30:06,940
I'll take it since you made it for me.

339
00:30:28,980 --> 00:30:32,300
Unbelievable!

340
00:30:32,340 --> 00:30:34,000
Long time no see.

341
00:30:34,040 --> 00:30:35,500
You look even more handsome.

342
00:30:35,540 --> 00:30:37,040
Who is that stand behind you?

343
00:30:37,070 --> 00:30:38,610
One plus one.

344
00:30:39,790 --> 00:30:40,580
Sandra,

345
00:30:40,620 --> 00:30:41,760
has anything good happened?

346
00:30:43,260 --> 00:30:46,740
I started a new business.

347
00:30:46,770 --> 00:30:48,300
It's magical.

348
00:30:48,340 --> 00:30:49,980
It tastes delicious.

349
00:30:50,010 --> 00:30:51,660
Take a few drops.

350
00:30:51,700 --> 00:30:55,490
It'll help with your immune system, blood circulation and increase your stamina.

351
00:30:55,520 --> 00:30:58,320
You sell it for 20000KRW while buy it for 1000KRW.

352
00:30:58,360 --> 00:30:59,170
We'll get arrested again.

353
00:30:59,210 --> 00:31:01,280
Stop! If you take it,

354
00:31:01,320 --> 00:31:04,820
you can get rid of the fat around your stomach as well.

355
00:31:04,860 --> 00:31:09,810
Would you like to be my partner in this miraculous business?

356
00:31:11,170 --> 00:31:12,170
Sandra.

357
00:31:12,200 --> 00:31:16,010
It was his birthday today, I want to treat him to a dinner.

358
00:31:16,480 --> 00:31:17,800
His birthday?

359
00:31:17,830 --> 00:31:19,040
Really?

360
00:31:19,350 --> 00:31:21,670
We should celebrate it.

361
00:31:21,700 --> 00:31:28,430
Happy birthday to you! Happy birthday to you!

362
00:31:28,460 --> 00:31:32,200
Our dear Mr. Jo.

363
00:31:32,210 --> 00:31:34,430
Happy birthday to you.

364
00:31:44,010 --> 00:31:47,010
Why don't you join us for dinner?

365
00:31:47,010 --> 00:31:48,320
Have a seat.

366
00:31:54,460 --> 00:31:57,080
Kwang Soo, eat with us.

367
00:31:57,080 --> 00:31:59,020
Don't just stand there. Come and have a seat.

368
00:31:59,020 --> 00:32:00,010
Come on.

369
00:32:00,010 --> 00:32:01,870
Let's eat.

370
00:32:03,110 --> 00:32:04,580
Have a seat.

371
00:32:04,580 --> 00:32:05,640
Drink it.

372
00:32:05,640 --> 00:32:07,080
Wow,

373
00:32:07,080 --> 00:32:09,340
a new face! Welcome!

374
00:32:09,340 --> 00:32:12,840
What's your name? What's your phone number?

375
00:32:12,840 --> 00:32:13,930
I'm Choi Kwang Soo.

376
00:32:13,930 --> 00:32:16,150
Choi Kwang Soo. I like that name.

377
00:32:16,150 --> 00:32:17,460
Try it.

378
00:32:17,460 --> 00:32:18,740
It's delicious.

379
00:32:20,650 --> 00:32:22,680
Have a drink.

380
00:32:23,760 --> 00:32:25,040
Go ahead. Drink up.

381
00:32:25,040 --> 00:32:26,870
It's okay. I'll call a designated driver.

382
00:32:26,870 --> 00:32:27,910
Drink as you wish.

383
00:32:27,910 --> 00:32:30,570
You won't sleep at night.

384
00:32:31,710 --> 00:32:33,190
Don't give him too much at once.

385
00:32:33,190 --> 00:32:34,700
Let's sing a song.

386
00:32:34,700 --> 00:32:35,780
Kwang Soo, sing a song.

387
00:32:35,780 --> 00:32:40,160
Sing! Sing! If you can't sing, you can't get married.

388
00:32:40,160 --> 00:32:42,960
Poor guy.

389
00:32:42,960 --> 00:32:45,600
If you don't sing, we'll make you.

390
00:32:45,600 --> 00:32:48,130
If you don't sing, we'll make you.

391
00:32:48,130 --> 00:32:50,320
One! Hey! Two! Hey!

392
00:32:50,320 --> 00:32:53,250
Three! Go! One, two! One, two, three, four!

393
00:32:53,250 --> 00:32:53,800
When are you going to start?

394
00:32:53,800 --> 00:32:57,330
My love for you is unconditional.

395
00:32:57,330 --> 00:33:00,610
Unconditional, unconditional.

396
00:33:00,610 --> 00:33:03,960
My love for you

397
00:33:03,960 --> 00:33:07,090
is incomparable.

398
00:34:12,660 --> 00:34:14,260
It's me.

399
00:34:18,090 --> 00:34:23,740
My father. Is he in the operating room?

400
00:34:32,480 --> 00:34:36,280
You can't meet her without an appointment.

401
00:34:36,720 --> 00:34:38,460
Could you please

402
00:34:38,460 --> 00:34:40,530
take this to her?

403
00:34:40,530 --> 00:34:44,280
I made it last week, and it tastes perfect now.

404
00:34:45,120 --> 00:34:47,030
Please.

405
00:34:55,370 --> 00:34:56,720
Sir,

406
00:34:56,720 --> 00:34:58,980
I found Ms. Lee Hye Jin.

407
00:34:59,050 --> 00:35:00,640
Who?

408
00:35:03,500 --> 00:35:05,620
Ms. Kang Yoo Jung's cellmate.

409
00:35:06,500 --> 00:35:08,410
Why did she report Yoo Jung?

410
00:35:08,410 --> 00:35:13,100
After she made a report to the police, Ahn Do Hoon wrote a letter of recommendation for her.

411
00:35:13,100 --> 00:35:16,420
- she was transferred to a job training center. - What?

412
00:35:24,330 --> 00:35:27,500
This is the surveillance camera footage that Ms. Lee Ja Yeong requested.

413
00:35:40,770 --> 00:35:42,720
Please forgive me this once.

414
00:35:42,720 --> 00:35:45,310
I can't let my father go just like that.

415
00:35:47,250 --> 00:35:48,890
They found my father.

416
00:35:48,890 --> 00:35:51,210
- Where is he? - Pohang.

417
00:35:59,900 --> 00:36:02,090
Dad. Dad.

418
00:36:02,090 --> 00:36:10,070
Dad. Dad...

419
00:36:19,920 --> 00:36:23,190
I want to stay with you.

420
00:36:23,190 --> 00:36:25,280
Is this because of Do Hoon?

421
00:36:27,490 --> 00:36:29,520
Ahn Do Hoon.

422
00:36:33,460 --> 00:36:35,570
Ahn Do Hoon.

423
00:36:51,610 --> 00:36:55,920
That was Hannamdong Lady. Min Hyuk went to see her again.

424
00:36:56,830 --> 00:37:00,350
She was wondering who Kang Yoo Jung was.

425
00:37:02,460 --> 00:37:05,410
I guess she did well.

426
00:37:05,410 --> 00:37:08,620
I didn't think she'd invest money for sentimental reasons.

427
00:37:08,620 --> 00:37:11,600
We don't know that.

428
00:37:14,070 --> 00:37:17,250
She's not curious about who you are though.

429
00:37:23,710 --> 00:37:25,890
Would you like to have one?

430
00:37:27,330 --> 00:37:34,630
- Are you determined to do this? - Why? Do you want to stop me?

431
00:37:36,410 --> 00:37:38,760
What's our relationship?

432
00:37:39,660 --> 00:37:44,280
Are you in a deeper relationship with Jo Min Hyuk than you are with me?

433
00:37:46,090 --> 00:37:48,400
Do you want me?

434
00:37:49,460 --> 00:37:54,410
Then separate her from Min Hyuk.

435
00:37:56,140 --> 00:37:57,340
Can you do that for me?

436
00:37:57,340 --> 00:38:02,170
If I do that, will you be with me?

437
00:38:03,410 --> 00:38:06,410
What should I do?

438
00:38:07,310 --> 00:38:09,640
I have to get married with him.

439
00:38:11,260 --> 00:38:14,920
Would you be happy as my lover?

440
00:38:52,310 --> 00:38:57,720
Both of us are silly. Right?

441
00:39:14,990 --> 00:39:17,100
You don't need to stay up like that.

442
00:39:17,100 --> 00:39:18,880
This isn't about business.

443
00:39:18,880 --> 00:39:21,970
If this isn't about business, I wouldn't be here.

444
00:39:22,290 --> 00:39:25,110
I have work to do.

445
00:39:27,070 --> 00:39:29,120
I'll be brief then.

446
00:39:31,370 --> 00:39:37,030
Lee Hye Jin. She reported Yoo Jung for child maltreatment.

447
00:39:37,030 --> 00:39:39,300
Cellmate, right?

448
00:39:40,780 --> 00:39:42,970
Why did you write a recommendation for her?

449
00:39:44,760 --> 00:39:46,870
It has nothing to do with you.

450
00:39:46,870 --> 00:39:48,770
It has nothing to do with me,

451
00:39:48,770 --> 00:39:51,320
but it has something to do with Yoo Jung.

452
00:39:51,320 --> 00:39:54,630
She used to try hard to protect you at all costs,

453
00:39:54,630 --> 00:39:58,630
why has she turned her back on you. I'm really curious about that.

454
00:39:59,800 --> 00:40:03,230
There is no secret in this world, right?

455
00:40:03,890 --> 00:40:06,390
What is it that you want to say?

456
00:40:06,390 --> 00:40:11,100
A prosecutor, who advocated justice,

457
00:40:11,100 --> 00:40:14,210
took his own son away.

458
00:40:16,690 --> 00:40:20,830
I told you that you and I weren't different.

459
00:40:20,830 --> 00:40:23,980
I want to take back my words.

460
00:40:24,090 --> 00:40:27,930
I'm not as vicious as you.

461
00:40:29,120 --> 00:40:31,650
Is this why Yoo Jung left you?

462
00:40:31,650 --> 00:40:35,980
Or do you have more secrets I don't know about?

463
00:40:35,980 --> 00:40:40,490
Preventing her parole was your idea.

464
00:40:40,490 --> 00:40:46,540
- Don't blame me, it's you who made the choice. - Jo Min Hyuk!

465
00:40:46,540 --> 00:40:50,300
You're the one who stamped "denied" on the paper, not me.

466
00:40:50,300 --> 00:40:53,170
I just wanted her to stay in jail

467
00:40:53,200 --> 00:40:55,390
just like you wish.

468
00:40:55,390 --> 00:41:00,540
But I'm regreting about that now.

469
00:41:02,120 --> 00:41:05,580
Even before her parole was denied,

470
00:41:05,580 --> 00:41:08,500
it was already decided

471
00:41:08,870 --> 00:41:12,070
that she wouldn't qualify for parole.

472
00:41:12,070 --> 00:41:15,920
That's why we deny her parole.

473
00:41:15,920 --> 00:41:17,730
Did you feel it bothers you?

474
00:41:17,730 --> 00:41:19,410
You're afraid that others will know what you did,

475
00:41:19,410 --> 00:41:22,300
so you hired someone to make the parole itself impossible.

476
00:41:27,620 --> 00:41:29,290
Take him.

477
00:41:29,290 --> 00:41:33,360
San. He's not recovered yet.

478
00:41:33,950 --> 00:41:34,440
Where are you taking San?

479
00:41:34,440 --> 00:41:37,180
San! San!

480
00:41:37,180 --> 00:41:38,900
Let go of me! Let go of me!

481
00:41:42,280 --> 00:41:44,160
It's too mean.

482
00:41:45,630 --> 00:41:48,150
Yoo Jung is so poor.

483
00:41:53,430 --> 00:41:55,950
How can you judge me like that?

484
00:41:56,370 --> 00:42:01,350
Both you and me didn't protect our woman.

485
00:42:02,220 --> 00:42:05,120
Ji Hee!

486
00:42:12,380 --> 00:42:19,700
Good! That's what I wanted to see.

487
00:42:19,700 --> 00:42:24,390
Revealing your secrets one by one will be me more fun that way.

488
00:42:39,580 --> 00:42:46,690
What happened to Yoo Jung's father... I'll look into it later.

489
00:42:59,770 --> 00:43:02,370
I didn't know you were coming.

490
00:43:03,510 --> 00:43:05,230
Your apartment is good,

491
00:43:05,230 --> 00:43:07,390
but it must be boring.

492
00:43:09,930 --> 00:43:12,770
You don't look good.

493
00:43:13,060 --> 00:43:15,150
What's going on?

494
00:43:18,020 --> 00:43:22,400
- Nothing. Where's mom? - She said she had an appointment,

495
00:43:22,400 --> 00:43:25,310
and didn't come to the restaurant for a whole day.

496
00:43:27,530 --> 00:43:29,800
Don't worry about us.

497
00:43:29,800 --> 00:43:31,700
She said we should move,

498
00:43:31,700 --> 00:43:34,260
but I talked her out of it.

499
00:43:35,300 --> 00:43:37,950
Since you left, this place feels empty.

500
00:43:37,950 --> 00:43:40,580
We don't need a big place.

501
00:43:40,960 --> 00:43:44,410
It's old, and the slope is hard for you.

502
00:43:44,680 --> 00:43:46,410
Move to a comfortable place.

503
00:43:46,410 --> 00:43:49,660
I don't have to listen to the gossips outside,

504
00:43:49,660 --> 00:43:52,940
and run my own restaurant,

505
00:43:52,940 --> 00:43:55,100
I don't want anything more.

506
00:43:56,810 --> 00:43:58,300
What?

507
00:44:02,450 --> 00:44:07,470
Father. I'm doing good, right?

508
00:44:10,430 --> 00:44:13,340
Why is the door open?

509
00:44:13,340 --> 00:44:14,540
Oops! You scared me!

510
00:44:14,540 --> 00:44:16,590
Why are you scared of your son?

511
00:44:16,590 --> 00:44:18,010
No!

512
00:44:21,760 --> 00:44:24,730
You should've called.

513
00:44:24,730 --> 00:44:29,610
You're the one who hasn't called and have been gone all day. Where did you go?

514
00:44:29,610 --> 00:44:33,200
Well... I...

515
00:44:37,480 --> 00:44:39,180
Nothing...

516
00:44:39,180 --> 00:44:41,140
I'll get changed first.

517
00:44:41,140 --> 00:44:42,640
Okay.

518
00:44:42,640 --> 00:44:44,770
What's wrong with her?

519
00:44:51,180 --> 00:44:55,900
Have you eaten? I'll prepare some food for you.

520
00:44:56,320 --> 00:44:58,750
What's wrong with her today?

521
00:44:58,750 --> 00:45:01,080
She is in such a panic.

522
00:45:03,650 --> 00:45:06,940
Hello. We're from King's Restaurant.

523
00:45:07,370 --> 00:45:09,040
Hello.

524
00:45:15,130 --> 00:45:17,410
I asked for you.

525
00:45:17,410 --> 00:45:19,140
I haven't had a chance to held a birthday party for Min Hyuk.

526
00:45:19,140 --> 00:45:21,090
I have to held one for him now.

527
00:45:21,090 --> 00:45:22,470
Yes.

528
00:45:22,470 --> 00:45:26,970
Set the table up over there. You can cook over there.

529
00:45:27,950 --> 00:45:30,330
One's enough. You can go.

530
00:45:31,740 --> 00:45:33,160
Is that okay?

531
00:45:33,160 --> 00:45:37,970
Yes? Sure.

532
00:45:45,940 --> 00:45:49,120
Min Hyuk! Min Hyuk!

533
00:45:53,990 --> 00:45:57,700
Your father was sent into the recovery room yesterday.

534
00:45:58,850 --> 00:45:59,930
How is he?

535
00:45:59,930 --> 00:46:03,650
It's too soon to tell, but he should be fine.

536
00:46:04,160 --> 00:46:07,940
He'll attend a meeting in Berlin before he comes back.

537
00:46:07,940 --> 00:46:12,290
It'll be a good opportunity to show people that he's okay.

538
00:46:14,430 --> 00:46:18,930
I heard about the investment. Good job.

539
00:46:19,430 --> 00:46:23,290
She asked me about the girl you were with.

540
00:46:23,290 --> 00:46:25,890
Is she the one you told me about before?

541
00:46:25,890 --> 00:46:27,760
I know what I'm doing.

542
00:46:27,760 --> 00:46:30,610
Your personal life is not my concern,

543
00:46:30,610 --> 00:46:32,840
but I think you should be aware that

544
00:46:32,840 --> 00:46:35,130
if anything affects your marriage with Se Yeon, it would lead to a terrible consequence.

545
00:46:35,130 --> 00:46:47,540
Why aren't you handing Ahn Do Hoon's file over?

546
00:46:47,540 --> 00:46:50,850
He cleaned up your mess.

547
00:46:50,850 --> 00:46:53,980
Other than trying to control the board,

548
00:46:53,980 --> 00:46:56,790
he's a good asset to our group.

549
00:46:56,790 --> 00:46:58,970
We still have a use for him.

550
00:46:58,970 --> 00:47:02,360
I'm more worried about Se Yeon.

551
00:47:03,030 --> 00:47:05,650
Mr. Ahn and Se Yeon.

552
00:47:05,650 --> 00:47:07,940
Keep an eye on them.

553
00:47:12,710 --> 00:47:15,890
Min Hyuk's running late.

554
00:47:31,490 --> 00:47:34,750
Min Hyuk, happy birthday!

555
00:47:35,380 --> 00:47:36,760
What?

556
00:47:36,760 --> 00:47:39,420
I never thought you'd settle for one woman.

557
00:47:39,420 --> 00:47:42,420
Se Yeon sure is something.

558
00:47:42,420 --> 00:47:44,380
Happy birthday, Min Hyuk!

559
00:47:50,230 --> 00:47:53,160
I didn't have a chance to wish you a happy birthday.

560
00:47:53,160 --> 00:47:54,500
Would you like a drink?

561
00:47:56,340 --> 00:47:58,810
Can you bring us some wine?

562
00:48:06,650 --> 00:48:08,620
What are you doing here?

563
00:48:22,260 --> 00:48:26,500
What's this? What do you want?

564
00:48:26,500 --> 00:48:30,450
I told you. I wanted to wish you a happy birthday

565
00:48:30,450 --> 00:48:32,960
and to congratulate you on your success of getting the investment,

566
00:48:32,960 --> 00:48:36,470
as well as our marriage, in advance.

567
00:48:36,470 --> 00:48:37,640
Se Yeon!

568
00:48:37,640 --> 00:48:40,410
My friends are here.

569
00:48:41,270 --> 00:48:43,500
I want you to be respectful.

570
00:48:47,600 --> 00:48:49,400
Can you clean this up?

571
00:49:19,660 --> 00:49:21,860
Serve the coffee for us.

572
00:49:24,820 --> 00:49:26,030
Yes.

573
00:49:51,040 --> 00:49:52,360
Sorry.

574
00:49:53,240 --> 00:49:54,550
What?

575
00:49:54,550 --> 00:49:56,150
Thank you.

576
00:49:57,250 --> 00:50:01,280
Thanks to the studd you sent this morning,

577
00:50:01,910 --> 00:50:07,970
Hannamdong Lady decided to help us.

578
00:50:11,530 --> 00:50:13,320
Really?

579
00:50:17,420 --> 00:50:21,660
I'm glad. I'm so glad.

580
00:50:23,020 --> 00:50:24,720
What are you doing?

581
00:50:33,910 --> 00:50:35,660
Is the coffee ready?

582
00:50:37,400 --> 00:50:38,830
It's done.

583
00:50:44,530 --> 00:50:45,530
I'll do it.

584
00:50:45,530 --> 00:50:49,310
Go out.

585
00:51:01,810 --> 00:51:04,430
My friends are gone.

586
00:51:04,430 --> 00:51:07,030
The four of us can have a drink now.

587
00:51:07,030 --> 00:51:08,570
The four of us?

588
00:51:28,480 --> 00:51:30,470
Bring out some dessert.

589
00:51:46,040 --> 00:51:48,450
I thought you'd enjoy it.

590
00:51:49,050 --> 00:51:52,030
Pretending not to know the truth.

591
00:51:52,030 --> 00:51:52,960
Se Yeon.

592
00:51:52,960 --> 00:51:54,890
What do you think, Yoo Jung?

593
00:51:56,740 --> 00:51:59,770
The guy you used to date,

594
00:51:59,770 --> 00:52:03,160
and the guy who's torturing you.

595
00:52:05,480 --> 00:52:08,780
Which one

596
00:52:09,190 --> 00:52:11,160
do you despise more?

597
00:52:11,160 --> 00:52:13,770
Don't answer that.

598
00:52:13,770 --> 00:52:17,200
She has no feeling to me.

599
00:52:17,200 --> 00:52:20,230
When she broke up with me, she told me not to feel guilty of each other.

600
00:52:22,370 --> 00:52:26,380
What? Do you have something to say?

601
00:52:28,020 --> 00:52:30,560
Sorry.

602
00:52:30,560 --> 00:52:36,990
You two look dangerous.

603
00:52:42,200 --> 00:52:46,400
You two look good together.

604
00:52:53,440 --> 00:52:56,970
I think my job here is done. I'll be off.

605
00:52:56,970 --> 00:52:59,900
I'll come back for the plates tomorrow.

606
00:53:09,490 --> 00:53:15,390
So? Don't you like this? This is my gift.

607
00:53:15,390 --> 00:53:16,580
Do you like it?

608
00:53:16,580 --> 00:53:17,520
Do you feel it fun?

609
00:53:17,520 --> 00:53:20,040
I thought you were the one

610
00:53:20,040 --> 00:53:21,750
who did stuff like this for fun.

611
00:53:21,750 --> 00:53:26,840
I told you not to interrupt while I'm talking to Se Yeon.

612
00:53:34,860 --> 00:53:40,170
I think I'll give you my present soon.

613
00:53:40,170 --> 00:53:43,470
Mr. Ahn. You know what?

614
00:53:45,470 --> 00:53:49,670
Those who pretend to be strong are actually nothing.

615
00:53:50,190 --> 00:53:55,140
You look very insecure at the moment.

616
00:53:59,850 --> 00:54:05,370
Thank you for the party.

617
00:54:36,220 --> 00:54:37,320
Get in!

618
00:54:37,320 --> 00:54:39,080
I'll take the bus.

619
00:54:39,080 --> 00:54:40,470
Get in!

620
00:54:41,940 --> 00:54:44,380
You said you'd listen to me.

621
00:54:44,380 --> 00:54:45,780
Get in.

622
00:54:48,160 --> 00:54:50,870
I know Min Hyuk.

623
00:54:51,420 --> 00:54:55,470
I've known him since kindergarten.

624
00:54:58,980 --> 00:55:00,390
When Seo Ji Hee died,

625
00:55:00,390 --> 00:55:03,210
I thought I could have him.

626
00:55:17,070 --> 00:55:20,420
The way he looked at her

627
00:55:23,910 --> 00:55:25,920
is love.

628
00:55:57,580 --> 00:56:02,530
Thank you for the ride, sir.
